WEBVTT

00:00:05.080 --> 00:00:08.500
With a clear understanding of what conversational AI is,

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:12.400
the next logical question that follows is how it actually works.

00:00:12.880 --> 00:00:16.689
While interacting with conversational AI can feel simple,

00:00:16.689 --> 00:00:19.120
a lot is happening behind the scenes.

00:00:19.440 --> 00:00:24.614
Each message goes through a series of steps that work together to capture input,

00:00:24.614 --> 00:00:28.320
understand meaning, and generate an appropriate response.

00:00:28.520 --> 00:00:33.282
These steps happen in real time and are designed to make interactions feel

00:00:33.282 --> 00:00:34.680
natural and efficient.

00:00:35.240 --> 00:00:39.504
At a high level, conversational a I follows a clear

00:00:39.504 --> 00:00:40.160
process.

00:00:40.560 --> 00:00:46.560
It begins by capturing the user 's input, whether that input is text or voice.

00:00:46.680 --> 00:00:51.640
Voice interactions rely on ASR, or automatic speech recognition,

00:00:51.640 --> 00:00:56.600
which converts spoken language into text the system can process.

00:00:57.280 --> 00:01:00.980
Next, the system analyzes the language itself

00:01:00.980 --> 00:01:04.360
using NLP, or natural language processing.

00:01:04.920 --> 00:01:08.936
This helps break the input into structured components that can be

00:01:08.936 --> 00:01:10.640
interpreted more accurately.

00:01:11.720 --> 00:01:17.250
Once the language is processed, NLU, or natural Language Understanding,

00:01:17.250 --> 00:01:18.480
comes into play.

00:01:18.600 --> 00:01:22.720
This is where the system determines intent and context,

00:01:22.720 --> 00:01:28.680
focusing on what the user is trying to achieve rather than the exact words used.

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:34.400
With intent understood, the system decides how to respond.

00:01:34.920 --> 00:01:37.914
It may retrieve information, generate a reply,

00:01:37.914 --> 00:01:41.800
or ask a follow up question to move the interaction forward.

00:01:42.440 --> 00:01:46.511
Finally, conversational AI systems improve over

00:01:46.511 --> 00:01:49.480
time by learning from interactions.

00:01:50.120 --> 00:01:56.974
Feedback, usage patterns, and outcomes help refine future responses

00:01:56.999 --> 00:01:59.160
and make conversations more effective.

00:01:59.920 --> 00:02:05.560
Modern conversational AI also benefits from enhancements such as speech

00:02:05.560 --> 00:02:10.351
synthesis, retrieval, augmented generation, vector databases,

00:02:10.351 --> 00:02:12.360
and real time translation.

00:02:13.080 --> 00:02:19.040
These technologies further improve accuracy, responsiveness, and scalability.

00:02:19.560 --> 00:02:22.622
Together, these components explain how

00:02:22.622 --> 00:02:28.120
conversational AI moves from a simple input to a meaningful response.

00:02:28.560 --> 00:02:31.780
In the next section, we will explore how these capabilities

00:02:31.780 --> 00:02:35.530
appear in different types of conversational AI systems used in

00:02:35.530 --> 00:02:36.040
practice.